candidates.text:
Marriage is actually quite effortless if you marry someone with a generous personality, consistent values, and enough intellect to be able to question themselves, relearn who they are, grow throughout the years and the decades; 

the problem is, you won’t attract such a person until you become such a person yourself, and a lot of people overestimate their own qualities and what they are bringing on the table;

most relationship issues are actually self-assessment issues.
